rem Counting Hexagons
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=577

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg N integer = 12345

rem A hexagon has a side vector (a, b)
rem and its 60 degree turn; for each
rem k = a + b there are k of them and
rem one needs a triangle of side 3k,
rem leaving C(n - 3k + 2, 2) places in
rem side n. Summed over n = 3 .. N this
rem is sum k C(N - 3k + 3, 3).
K = 1 to (N // 3) array
M = N - 3 * K + 1
Tm = K * M * (M + 1) * (M + 2) // 6
Answer = Tm sum
Answer print
